<title>USA: Pep Boys stake held by Mercury Asset Mgmt.</title>
<headline>Pep Boys stake held by Mercury Asset Mgmt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercury Asset Management plc on Monday said it holds 3,188,491 shares, or a 5.04 percent stake in Pep Boys Manny Moe and Jack.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the London-based investment firm said it most recently acquired shares of the Philadelphia-based auto parts retailer between March 24 and June 20 at $30.38 to $34.69 each.</p>
<p>Mercury said it holds shares in Pep Boys for investment purposes only.</p>
